{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamcrafter is a crafting and gathering Roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like risking your life, fighting big monsters to save people you don't even know? Of course not, you'd be crazy right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An infinite amount of worlds to visit</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore procedural biomes</strong>, caves, plains, forests, swamps, deserts, snowy mountains, windy places, magical caves, lava worlds, and much more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replay to the infinity !</strong>\u00a0More than a hundred of collectables, over 40 talents, 50 passive items, every run is different and it's just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic fights</strong> with flashy spells, epic attacks, inspired from old JRPGs mixed with modern aethetics. Enjoy an automated turn-by-turn combat system with everything you need to monitor the fight, your party and help them succeed!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405680?t=1744790511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744790511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/54ede02373c1b5a05a468d171332b0951d4205e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744790511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/54ede02373c1b5a05a468d171332b0951d4205e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744790511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor